### PayVault demo requests - open in IntelliJ / VS Code (REST Client extension) or copy into Postman.
### Everything goes through the API Gateway on 8080.

@gw = http://localhost:8080

### 1. Register WWW (returns tokens - copy accessToken into @tokenA)
POST {{gw}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "fullName": "WWW", "email": "www@payvault.dev", "phone": "9000000001", "password": "secret123" }

### 2. Register XYZ
POST {{gw}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "fullName": "XYZ", "email": "xyz@payvault.dev", "phone": "9000000002", "password": "secret123" }

### 3. Login as WWW
POST {{gw}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "www@payvault.dev", "password": "secret123" }

@tokenA = paste-www-access-token-here

### 4. Deposit 500 into WWW's wallet
POST {{gw}}/api/transactions/deposit
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenA}}
Idempotency-Key: deposit-demo-1
Content-Type: application/json

{ "amount": 500.00 }

### 5. Find XYZ by phone
GET {{gw}}/api/users/lookup?query=9000000002
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenA}}

### 6. Transfer 150 from WWW to XYZ (use XYZ's id from step 5)
POST {{gw}}/api/transactions/transfer
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenA}}
Idempotency-Key: transfer-demo-1
Content-Type: application/json

{ "receiverId": 2, "amount": 150.00, "note": "Lunch" }

### 7. Send step 6 AGAIN with the same Idempotency-Key -> same txnRef, money moves only once
POST {{gw}}/api/transactions/transfer
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenA}}
Idempotency-Key: transfer-demo-1
Content-Type: application/json

{ "receiverId": 2, "amount": 150.00, "note": "Lunch" }

### 8. Balance -> 350.00
GET {{gw}}/api/wallets/me
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenA}}

### 9. Ledger: DEBIT 150.00, balanceBefore 500.00, balanceAfter 350.00
GET {{gw}}/api/wallets/me/ledger
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenA}}

### 10. Reconciliation: wallet balance == credits - debits
GET {{gw}}/api/wallets/me/reconcile
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenA}}

### 11. Transfer more than the balance -> 422 FAILED "Insufficient balance"
POST {{gw}}/api/transactions/transfer
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenA}}
Idempotency-Key: transfer-demo-2
Content-Type: application/json

{ "receiverId": 2, "amount": 9999.00 }

### 12. History
GET {{gw}}/api/transactions
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenA}}

### 13. Circuit breaker state (stop wallet-service, send a few transfers, then call this)
GET {{gw}}/api/transactions/circuit
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenA}}

### 14. Internal endpoints are not reachable through the Gateway (no route + filter blocks /internal) -> 404/403
POST {{gw}}/internal/wallets/1/credit
Content-Type: application/json

{ "txnRef": "hack", "amount": 1000000 }

### 15. No token -> 401
GET {{gw}}/api/wallets/me
